  Description: Your armor's defenses ablate any kind of energy coming your way. While
    wearing your armor, you gain resistance to all energy damage (acid, cold, electricity,
    fire, force, sonic, vitality, and void damage) equal to 2 + half your level.
    You must have the harmonic oscillator, metallic reactance, or phlogistonic regulator
    modification to select this modification.
